title: 1930 root
# Starting in 1930. The shared defaults are applied by initialize_game.scene.dry,
# which is called below; this file only contains the qualities whose 1930 values
# differ from the 1928 defaults, applied afterwards by @1930_root_setup.
# (call: runs after this scene's own on-arrival, hence the two steps.)
